WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.133
Guys, today is Friday,
and that's usually

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.868
when I catch up
on some personal stuff.

00:00:04.868 --> 00:00:06.634
I check my inbox,
I return some e-mails,

00:00:06.634 --> 00:00:08.067
and, of course,
I send out Thank You Notes.

00:00:08.067 --> 00:00:09.334
I like to write out
Thank You Notes.

00:00:09.334 --> 00:00:11.701
[ Cheers and applause ]
Don't we do --

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:13.534
I'd like to write out some
weekly Thank You Notes

00:00:13.534 --> 00:00:15.033
right now for you guys.
Do you guys mind

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:16.133
if I write some out tonight?

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:17.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:19.734
I appreciate it!

00:00:19.734 --> 00:00:22.434
James, can I get some Thank
You Note writing music, please?

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:25.200
♪♪

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.601
Wow.
-He's not in his wig.

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:27.968
-Yeah, he's in a good mood.

00:00:27.968 --> 00:00:29.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.934
I like his shirt.
-Yeah. It's classy.

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:36.434
Yeah, it's like --
It's like a rust color.

00:00:36.434 --> 00:00:38.200
-Yeah. Let's see it again.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:40.934
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:40.934 --> 00:00:43.334
That's beautiful, man.
He's called "Mr. Autumn."

00:00:43.334 --> 00:00:45.834
-Yeah.
Mr. Autumn, they call him. Yeah.

00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:47.167
-That's right.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.834
-His shirts change
like the leaves.

00:00:48.834 --> 00:00:50.367
-Yeah.
-It's a beautiful thing.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:53.601
-Only once a year.
-Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.000
That's the same shirt he wore --

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.567
-Same shirt he wore last autumn.

00:00:57.567 --> 00:00:59.000
-It just progressively
gets filthy.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:01.100
-It's from the fall collection.
-Yeah. Until it falls off.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:02.467
-Yeah.
-And then he's shirtless.

00:01:02.467 --> 00:01:04.868
And then he shirtless.
-Get threadbare until it falls.

00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:06.734
And then we know
the times have changed.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:08.734
You know what I mean?
-That's the only way I know

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:11.200
that I'm alive, is to
see him change his clothes.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:14.167
It's beautiful to see you. James
from the Roots right there.

00:01:14.167 --> 00:01:16.200
James, can I get some
Thank You Note writing music?

00:01:16.200 --> 00:01:17.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:17.634 --> 00:01:20.200
♪♪

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.767
-Wow. He's an animatronic.
-Wow.

00:01:22.767 --> 00:01:24.100
-He's, like, animatronic.

00:01:24.100 --> 00:01:25.701
It's like he's in
the Chuck E. Cheese band.

00:01:25.701 --> 00:01:28.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:30.100
♪♪

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:32.968
Thank you, hay rides,
for letting me know

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.634
what Uberpool would be like
in 1835.

00:01:35.634 --> 00:01:37.067
You go, "Oh."

00:01:37.067 --> 00:01:39.901
[ Applause ]

00:01:39.901 --> 00:01:41.501
"Hop on the back!"

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:43.834
-"Have a seat!"
-"Have a seat!"

00:01:43.834 --> 00:01:45.067
-"Hay!"

00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:46.467
-[Singsong voice] "Hay!"

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:48.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.567
♪♪

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.868
-Thank you, Adirondack chairs,

00:01:51.868 --> 00:01:54.200
for looking like the skeleton
of a La-Z-Boy.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.467
-Ooh!
-Spooky. Spooky.

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:57.634
-Hallow-e-e-een!

00:01:57.634 --> 00:01:59.834
-Hallow-e-e-e-een!

00:01:59.834 --> 00:02:02.701
[ Laughs ]

00:02:02.701 --> 00:02:04.400
♪♪

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:06.067
Thank you, space bar,

00:02:06.067 --> 00:02:08.501
for being the manspreader
of the keyboard.

00:02:08.501 --> 00:02:10.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.434 --> 00:02:11.701
[ Applause ]

00:02:11.701 --> 00:02:14.968
"How much space you need?
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa."

00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:16.501
-"We got it."
"We got it.

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:18.200
Gosh. Sit normal, bud."

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:21.501
Oh, this is a good one.

00:02:21.501 --> 00:02:22.968
♪♪

00:02:22.968 --> 00:02:26.467
Thank you, Las Vegas Aces owner
Mark Davis,

00:02:26.467 --> 00:02:29.467
for ending the WNBA season
with a bangs.

00:02:29.467 --> 00:02:32.801
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:34.334
-Come on.
-He did a good job.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.934
-That's a good one.
-He did a good job.

00:02:35.934 --> 00:02:37.734
-Yeah.
-He did a great job.

00:02:37.734 --> 00:02:40.200
He ended with a bangs. Yeah.

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:42.767
♪♪

00:02:42.767 --> 00:02:45.868
Thank you, accidentally
breaking an olive-oil bottle

00:02:45.868 --> 00:02:48.067
on the ground,
for making me go,

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:51.334
"You know what?
Let's just move."

00:02:51.334 --> 00:02:53.300
"I'm not cleaning this up."

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:55.133
-Yeah.
"I'm not cleaning this up."

00:02:55.133 --> 00:02:57.133
-"It's gonna take me four years
to clean that up."

00:02:57.133 --> 00:02:58.834
-Them tiny slivers of glass
all day long.

00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:00.701
-Let's look at other --
Let's get on Zillow.

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:03.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:04.400
♪♪

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:07.000
Thank you, Jack-o'-lanterns,
for showing me

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:09.100
you don't need teeth
to be happy.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:10.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:11.367
-Aww.

00:03:11.367 --> 00:03:14.534
-Happy. Happy pumpkin.

00:03:17.834 --> 00:03:19.200
♪♪

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:21.467
Thank you,
"The Golden Bachelor."

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:22.901
You may not win any Emmys,

00:03:22.901 --> 00:03:25.067
but you're definitely
taking home some Grammys.

00:03:25.067 --> 00:03:26.400
Hey. There you have it.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.901 --> 00:03:29.701
Those are some Thank You Notes.

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:32.968
We'll be right back
with Keith Richards!

